index db5a398..87ee381 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,17 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Command line
+
+> java -jar cli/target/cli-1.0-jar-with-dependencies.jar <command> <options>
+
+Run without arguments to list all commands, or `<command> -help` for the options of one command. Main commands:
+* `init` - creates an analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports` - generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `updateConfig` - updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+* `analyzeLandscape` - creates or updates a landscape report aggregating the results of multiple analyses found under `-analysisRoot` (the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands)
+* `updateLandscape` - the same command as `analyzeLandscape`, kept so that existing scripts keep working
+
